          "id": "c",
          "label": "They refused to answer any questions",
          "correct": false,
          "rationale": "They answered, and got tangled."
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "label": "They all agreed with the oracle",
          "correct": false,
          "rationale": "The oracle had praised Socrates."
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "He found they thought they knew things they didn’t; he was wiser only in not thinking he knew.",
